<title>USA: Fairfield files for 2 mln share offering.</title>
<headline>Fairfield files for 2 mln share offering.</headline>
<dateline>LITTLE ROCK, Ark. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fairfield Communities Inc said on Monday it had filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission for an offering of two million shares.</p>
<p>It said 900,000 shares would be sold by the company and 1.1 million would be sold by Physicians Insurance Co of Ohio and its subsidiaries.</p>
<p>Fairfield said it would use its net proceeds to reduce debt and for other corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
